  "content": "[Intro]\n[Bmaj9]\n[F#aug]\n[Bmaj9]\n[F#aug]\n\n[Chorus]\n[B]You are the sun-\n[E6]shine of my life,\n[Ebm7]\n[G#13b9]\n[C#m7]That's why I'll al-\n[F#7sus4]ways be aro-\n[B]und.\n[C#m7]  [F#7/E]\n[B]You are the ap-\n[E6]ple of my eye,\n[Ebm7]\n[G#13b9]\n[C#m7]Forever you'll\n[F#7sus4]stay in my heart.\n[B]\n[C#m7]  [F#7/E]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bmaj7]I feel like this\n[E6]is the [F#9sus4]begin-\n[Bmaj7]ning.\n[E6]  [F#9sus4]\n[Bmaj7]Though I've loved you\n[E6]for a [G7]million years\n[Eb7].\n[Ebm7]\n[Abmaj7]And if I thought\n[C#maj7]our love [Ebmadd9]was\n[Abm7]ending,\nI'd find\n[Dbadd9]myself drown-\ning in my own-\n[F#7sus4]tears, Whoa\nwhoa.\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bmaj7]You are the sun-\n[E6]shine of my life,\n[Ebm7]yeah,\n[G#13b9]\n[C#m7]That's why I'll al-\n[F#7sus4]ways stay around.\n[B]Mmm\n[C#m7]mm yeah [F#7/E]yeah.\n[B]You are the ap-\n[E6]ple of my\n[Ebm7]eye,\n[G#13b9]\n[C#m7]Forever\n[F#7sus4]you'll stay in my\n[B]heart.\n[C#m7]  [F#7/E]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bmaj7]You must have\n[E6]known that [F#9sus4]I was\n[Bmaj7]lonely.\n[E6]  [F#9sus4]\n[Bmaj7]Because you\n[E6]came to my [G7]rescue\n[Eb7]\n[Ebm7]\n[Abmaj7]And I know that\n[C#maj7]this must [Ebmadd9]be\n[Abm7]heaven.\nHow could so\n[Dbadd9]much love be\ninsideof\n[F#7sus4]you? Whoa.\n[G7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cmaj7]You are the sun-\n[F6/D]shine of my\n[Em7]life, yeah,\n[A13b9]\n[Dm7]That's why I'll al-\n[G7sus4]ways stay around-\n[C]. Mmm,\n[Dm7]mmm. [G7]\n[Cmaj7]You are the ap-\n[F6/D]ple of my\n[Em7]eye,\n[A13b9]\n[Dm7]Forever you'll\n[G7sus4]stay in my heart-\n[C].\n[Dm7]Yeah. [G7]\n\n[Outro]\n[Cmaj7]You are the sun-\n[F6/D]shine of my\n[Em7]life,\n[A13b9]baby,\n[Dm7]That's why I'll al-\n[G7sus4]ways stay around---\n[C].",
